        <mxCell id="qiYp3C5U_6en0ntC8AVg-12" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=14;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;" value="&lt;b&gt;Quick Suite&lt;/b&gt;: enables &lt;b&gt;visualisation, &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;natural language queries (NLQ) and self service analytics using &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;data retrieved from the data store. The Quick Suite offers Generative AI and Agentic AI capabililties which securely reason on your organisation&#39;s proprietary data, while enforcing enterprise security &amp;amp; data governance principles at scale. A &lt;b&gt;semantic layer&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Athena&lt;/b&gt;: enables ad hoc querying of data in the Redshift data store, following the authorisations enforced by the Governance Catalog Layer.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="720" x="687" y="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qiYp3C5U_6en0ntC8AVg-19" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=14;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Redshift Spectrum&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;: enables querying of data in the Redshift data store&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Glue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;: _______________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;dbt (data build tool)&lt;/b&gt;: enables curation of the data from raw&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="154.25" width="720" x="687" y="225.75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qiYp3C5U_6en0ntC8AVg-23" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=14;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;" value="&lt;b&gt;Lake Formation&lt;/b&gt;: enables a data catalog which forms the data governance&amp;nbsp;spine across the various layers presented, forming the permissions and governance plane for all requesting and granting access to data objects." vertex="1">
